{emailSubject}New Submission After Acceptance - {$assignment}{/emailSubject}
<h1>New submission after acceptance — '{$assignment}'</h1>

<p>
    User <strong>{$user}</strong> has submitted a new solution of the assignment
    <strong>'{$assignment}'</strong> which was evaluated as <strong>{$score}%</strong> correct.
</p>

<p>
    Another solution of this user has been already marked as <strong>accepted</strong>,
    so this new submission will not affect points granted for the assignment unless the
    acceptance marks are changed. This may also mean that the user is submitting a corrected
    solution which may be worth your attention.
</p>

{button($link, 'Open the submission')|noescape}
